Z||000000||Fiero*101||11-06-2001||10:16 PM||||How do you post pics?<BR>my friend just got a new Digital Camara and he got pics of my car and i want to put it in my sig<BR>but i dont know how to do it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Fiero*101<BR>Gold 86 SE 2M6||||reg||1
Z||000001||Old Lar||11-06-2001||10:29 PM||||Go to the bottom of he page and click on Pennock's Image Poster.  Follow the instructions EXACTLY.  You will load a program that will allow you to down load JPG files.  Make sure you resize the photos to no more that 6 or 8 inhes wide.  File size should be about 100000 bytes.||||reg||1
Z||000002||maryjane||11-06-2001||10:30 PM||||click on the blue rectangle at the bottom of the page (very bottom) Pennocks Image poster.<BR>follow instructions to download it, you'll need a program like Winzip to unzip it after you download it. ||||reg||1
