Z||000004||maryjane||11-07-2001||10:51 PM||||after you click on 'post it', the upload bar will tell you when upload is complete. click 'ok'. Then, in your post, press 'ctrl-v' on your keyboard, you should see the [img] blah blah blah url looking thing appear on your post. When you click 'submit reply at the bottom of your post, it should work.||||reg||1
